%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrapPadding": 18}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User (operations)
  participant P as Platform API<br/>(/api/genbi/ask)
  participant SC as Schema introspection
  participant BR as Bedrock<br/>(Claude Opus, Converse)
  participant RS as Redshift (Data API)
  participant DDB as DynamoDB<br/>(bgp-genbi-history)
  U->>P: natural-language question
  P->>SC: fetch Redshift tables / columns → data catalog
  P->>BR: Converse(system prompt = catalog + read-only rules, tool = run_sql)
  loop multi-step reasoning (≤ maxIters)
    BR-->>P: tool_use: run_sql(SQL)
    P->>P: sql-guard read-only check<br/>+ row cap
    P->>RS: run read-only SQL
    RS-->>P: columns + rows
    P-->>BR: toolResult(data)
  end
  BR-->>P: final conclusion (in Chinese)
  P->>P: recommend a chart from the result shape<br/>(metric / bar / line / table)
  P->>DDB: best-effort record of the question history
  P-->>U: conclusion + generated SQL + data table + chart + reasoning steps
  Note over P,RS: Every number comes from a real query, all computation is done by Redshift
